-- Examples:
--   Pensacola: America/New_York → America/Chicago (FL panhandle is Central)
--   Chattanooga: America/Chicago → America/New_York (TN is Eastern)
--   Grand Rapids: America/Detroit → America/Chicago
--   Rapid City: America/Detroit → America/Denver
