-- Skipped: cities where GeoNames has a deprecated/old timezone ID
-- (e.g. America/Argentina/ComodRivadavia) — those would need extra IANA
-- timezones added to the time_zones table first.
--
-- Idempotent: only updates if cities.timezone != new value.

